*   **Formula:**
    $$B_{axis} = \frac{N \mu_0 I R^2}{2(R^2 + x^2)^{3/2}}$$
    *   $N$: Number of turns in the coil.
    *   $R$: Radius of the ring.
    *   $x$: Distance from the center along the axis.
